WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:04.204
-Chris and I are about to face
off in a game of Box of Lies.

00:00:04.204 --> 00:00:05.705 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:05.705 --> 00:00:06.940 line:92%
Now, here's how it works.

00:00:06.940 --> 00:00:09.075 line:92%
Upstage are nine mystery boxes

00:00:09.075 --> 00:00:12.178 align:start size:94% position:6%
containing objects
no one has ever seen before.

00:00:12.178 --> 00:00:12.912 size:88% position:44% line:92%
We'll play three rounds.

00:00:12.912 --> 00:00:17.450 align:start size:94% position:6%
Chris, why don't you pick
the first box...box...box...

00:00:17.450 --> 00:00:20.820 size:78% position:39% line:92%
[ Audience shouting ]

00:00:20.820 --> 00:00:23.423 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Four? Four?

00:00:23.423 --> 00:00:26.593 size:78% position:39% line:92%
[ Audience shouting ]

00:00:26.593 --> 00:00:28.294 line:92%
It's like "The Price is Right."

00:00:28.294 --> 00:00:29.829 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-All right.

00:00:29.829 --> 00:00:32.032 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:32.032 --> 00:00:35.201
There's my first hint there.
How much does the box weigh?

00:00:35.201 --> 00:00:37.303 align:start size:94% position:6%
Seems like not much.
-125 pounds.

00:00:37.303 --> 00:00:39.873 align:start size:94% position:6%
-125 pounds.
-I'm very strong.

00:00:39.873 --> 00:00:43.710 align:start size:94% position:6%
-All right.
[ Humming ]

00:00:43.710 --> 00:00:47.714 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
♪♪♪♪

00:00:47.714 --> 00:00:49.749 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:49.749 --> 00:00:52.986 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Jimmy humming ]

00:00:52.986 --> 00:00:54.454 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Okay.

00:00:54.454 --> 00:00:55.155 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
♪♪♪♪

00:00:55.155 --> 00:00:58.124
Now, you can either lie about
this or you can tell the truth.

00:00:58.124 --> 00:00:59.592 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
It's up to you.

00:00:59.592 --> 00:01:05.198 align:start size:94% position:6%
Tell me what the object is,
or you can tell me --

00:01:05.198 --> 00:01:07.500 align:start size:94% position:6%
You can tell me
what the object --

00:01:07.500 --> 00:01:09.369 line:92%
-It's, uh -- Is this real?

00:01:09.369 --> 00:01:11.504 line:92%
-No, look at me. All right.

00:01:11.504 --> 00:01:15.775 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-This is a small...

00:01:15.775 --> 00:01:17.377 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
diorama...

00:01:17.377 --> 00:01:23.116 line:92%
of little people, dwarves.

00:01:23.116 --> 00:01:24.784 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Dwarves.

00:01:24.784 --> 00:01:28.855 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Engaging in...
-Oh, my goodness.

00:01:28.855 --> 00:01:30.090 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-No.

00:01:30.090 --> 00:01:34.294 size:78% position:39% line:92%
-...stretching, yoga.

00:01:34.294 --> 00:01:37.464 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
And...

00:01:37.464 --> 00:01:40.767 line:92%
they're all wearing hats.

00:01:40.767 --> 00:01:41.935 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:41.935 --> 00:01:43.503 align:start size:94% position:6%
-All right,
so you're telling me --

00:01:43.503 --> 00:01:47.574 align:start size:94% position:6%
You're telling me that
what is in front of you...

00:01:47.574 --> 00:01:49.876 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:49.876 --> 00:01:53.346 align:start size:94% position:6%
...is a diorama of sorts,
which is something

00:01:53.346 --> 00:01:56.182 size:84% position:42%
I normally would make
in a shoe box, perhaps,

00:01:56.182 --> 00:01:57.250 line:92%
maybe when I was growing up,

00:01:57.250 --> 00:01:58.952 align:start size:94% position:6%
which is maybe
why you thought of that,

00:01:58.952 --> 00:02:01.488 align:start size:94% position:6%
because we have a box
and you thought of a shoe box,

00:02:01.488 --> 00:02:03.356 align:start size:94% position:6%
and then made up a lie
about a diorama,

00:02:03.356 --> 00:02:07.227 size:78% position:39%
which makes me think,
Chris Pratt, you lie!

00:02:07.227 --> 00:02:10.163 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Audience cheers ]

00:02:10.163 --> 00:02:11.698 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Sucka!

00:02:11.698 --> 00:02:14.033 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
♪♪♪♪

00:02:14.033 --> 00:02:16.536 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:16.536 --> 00:02:18.705 size:88% position:44% line:92%
-Oh. That was well done.

00:02:18.705 --> 00:02:20.340 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yes.

00:02:20.340 --> 00:02:21.774 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:21.774 --> 00:02:23.443 size:75% position:38% line:92%
-That was well done!

00:02:23.443 --> 00:02:27.180 align:start size:94% position:6%
You reeled me right in, man.
That was good.

00:02:27.180 --> 00:02:28.515 size:84% position:42% line:92%
Which one we going for?

00:02:28.515 --> 00:02:29.415 size:78% position:39% line:92%
[ Audience shouting ]

00:02:29.415 --> 00:02:34.721
Perfect. Six it is. Perfect.
Not one person yelled six.

00:02:34.721 --> 00:02:36.289 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
There we go.

00:02:36.289 --> 00:02:39.492 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Grunting ]

00:02:39.492 --> 00:02:41.928 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, wow!
That must be very heavy!

00:02:41.928 --> 00:02:45.098 align:start size:94% position:6%
You're trying to hide
how heavy it is.

00:02:45.098 --> 00:02:47.834 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-[ Panting ]

00:02:47.834 --> 00:02:52.038 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
♪♪♪♪

00:02:52.038 --> 00:02:53.907 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:53.907 --> 00:02:59.546 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
♪♪♪♪

00:02:59.546 --> 00:03:05.285 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
♪♪♪♪

00:03:05.285 --> 00:03:07.020 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Well...

00:03:07.020 --> 00:03:10.190
Well, I wouldn't be surprised
if you had one of these at home.

00:03:10.190 --> 00:03:12.325 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughs ]

00:03:12.325 --> 00:03:14.227 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
I got to be honest.

00:03:14.227 --> 00:03:17.297 size:81% position:41% line:92%
It's a...It's a, uh...

00:03:17.297 --> 00:03:21.534 align:start size:94% position:6%
a vibrating Jell-o mold
of Jeff Goldblum.

00:03:21.534 --> 00:03:23.469 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:23.469 --> 00:03:25.838 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
♪♪♪♪

00:03:25.838 --> 00:03:28.107 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I think you're
telling the truth.

00:03:28.107 --> 00:03:30.510 size:81% position:41% line:92%
-You were right! I am!

00:03:30.510 --> 00:03:33.046 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
♪♪♪♪

00:03:33.046 --> 00:03:34.280 line:92%
How would I make that up?

00:03:34.280 --> 00:03:36.950
I don't know how our writers
come up with these things.

00:03:36.950 --> 00:03:38.651 line:92%
-I do have one of those at home.

00:03:38.651 --> 00:03:41.287
I have two of them, because
they're just so much fun.

00:03:41.287 --> 00:03:43.957 align:start size:94% position:6%
All right. Chris, you're up.
-My turn.

00:03:43.957 --> 00:03:44.958 size:78% position:39% line:92%
[ Audience shouting ]

00:03:44.958 --> 00:03:48.394
-Man, you are good at this game.
Man, oh, man.

00:03:48.394 --> 00:03:50.063 size:78% position:39% line:92%
[ Audience shouting ]

00:03:50.063 --> 00:03:54.500
All right. I think it was heavy,
but you acted like it was light.

00:03:54.500 --> 00:03:56.469 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-[ Clears throat ]

00:03:56.469 --> 00:04:00.506
-All right. Oh, he's not even
looking. That's interesting.

00:04:00.506 --> 00:04:03.042 line:92%
Then I'm assuming you're lying.

00:04:03.042 --> 00:04:05.044 align:start size:94% position:6%
If you're not even
looking at it.

00:04:05.044 --> 00:04:05.812 line:92%
-I'll tell you what it is.

00:04:05.812 --> 00:04:10.850
-This is an interesting move.
I've never seen this before.

00:04:10.850 --> 00:04:13.786 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Ugh.

00:04:13.786 --> 00:04:15.722 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Okay.
-Oh.

00:04:15.722 --> 00:04:17.824 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Ooh!

00:04:17.824 --> 00:04:19.158 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Is that real?

00:04:19.158 --> 00:04:23.162 size:75% position:38%
-You said that about
the last one. Okay.

00:04:24.297 --> 00:04:30.570 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I don't think it's very nice
to do this to this thing.

00:04:30.570 --> 00:04:31.771 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Um...

00:04:31.771 --> 00:04:35.875 align:start size:94% position:6%
Maybe it's an omnivorous, uh,
creature, but it's --

00:04:35.875 --> 00:04:39.345 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Are you trying use big words
to trick me?

00:04:39.345 --> 00:04:40.513 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Gosh.

00:04:40.513 --> 00:04:43.116 align:start size:94% position:6%
-It's a skull,
and it's bedazzled.

00:04:43.116 --> 00:04:47.920 align:start size:94% position:6%
I think it might be a raccoon,
or it could be maybe a fox.

00:04:47.920 --> 00:04:50.857 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
But, um...

00:04:50.857 --> 00:04:53.359 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Is it a herbivore
or a carnivore?

00:04:53.359 --> 00:04:54.794 line:92%
-No, it's got pointy teeth.

00:04:54.794 --> 00:04:57.830
So I think it's maybe a predator
or maybe it's something

00:04:57.830 --> 00:05:00.433 align:start size:94% position:6%
that eats a bunch of stuff
like a raccoon

00:05:00.433 --> 00:05:01.234 line:92%
or, like, a possum or something.

00:05:01.234 --> 00:05:05.204 align:start size:94% position:6%
-That's interesting, because
last time you lied to me.

00:05:05.204 --> 00:05:05.972 size:84% position:42% line:92%
No, you told the truth,

00:05:05.972 --> 00:05:07.807
but you acted like you were
lying like you didn't know.

00:05:07.807 --> 00:05:10.009 align:start size:94% position:6%
And now you're acting like,
well, you don't know.

00:05:10.009 --> 00:05:12.078 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Oh, I don't know.
It could be a thing.

00:05:12.078 --> 00:05:14.681 align:start size:94% position:6%
I don't know.
I've never seen teeth before."

00:05:14.681 --> 00:05:16.683 align:start size:94% position:6%
You know?
Never seen teeth before?

00:05:16.683 --> 00:05:19.886 align:start size:94% position:6%
-That is the most ridiculous
thing I ever heard of.

00:05:19.886 --> 00:05:20.553 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
You have teeth.

00:05:20.553 --> 00:05:23.856 align:start size:94% position:6%
You brush them every day,
in the morning and at night!

00:05:23.856 --> 00:05:27.527 align:start size:94% position:6%
Chris Pratt,
you are telling the truth!

00:05:27.527 --> 00:05:30.430 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Unh! No, I'm not.

00:05:30.430 --> 00:05:31.564 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-You're not.

00:05:31.564 --> 00:05:36.436
He's a master! You are a master!
He is a master!

00:05:36.436 --> 00:05:39.072 size:84% position:42% line:92%
Chris Pratt, everybody!

